Miciri @VERSION@ (macOS arm64, VST3 and Audio Unit) - manual install / 手动安装

ENGLISH

  New to plug-ins? Use the installer instead (Miciri-v@VERSION@-macos-arm64.pkg).
  It does the steps below for you.

  1. Copy Miciri.vst3 to   ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3
     and Miciri.component to ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components
     Create the folders if they do not exist. To install for all users,
     use /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/... instead.
  2. Miciri is not signed or notarized, so macOS blocks it after a download.
     Clear the quarantine flag (use the paths you copied to):
       xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/Miciri.vst3
       xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/Miciri.component
  3. Rescan plug-ins in your DAW.

  To remove it, delete the two items you copied.

  Audio is analysed in memory only. It is never written to disk or sent anywhere,
  and the plug-in passes it through bit for bit.

中文

  不熟悉插件目录的话，建议用安装包（Miciri-v@VERSION@-macos-arm64.pkg），
  它会替你完成下面的步骤。

  1. 把 Miciri.vst3 复制到   ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3
     把 Miciri.component 复制到 ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components
     目录不存在就先建。要给所有用户安装，改用 /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/...。
  2. Miciri 没有签名和公证，下载后 macOS 会拦截它。
     用下面的命令解除隔离（路径换成你复制到的位置）：
       xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/Miciri.vst3
       xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/Miciri.component
  3. 在宿主里重新扫描插件。

  要卸载，删除你复制的这两项。

  音频只在内存里分析，不写盘，不上传，插件逐位直通。

LICENSE / 许可

  Miciri is free software under GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE). This binary
  combines Miciri with JUCE (used under AGPL-3.0), the VST3 SDK (GPL-3.0),
  the AudioUnitSDK (Apache-2.0) and pocketfft (BSD-3-Clause). The combined binary
  is distributed under GPLv3 and the JUCE parts under AGPLv3. The texts are in
  LICENSES/, and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md lists the third-party components.

  Miciri 是自由软件，许可为 GPL-3.0-or-later（见 LICENSE）。这个二进制把 Miciri
  与 JUCE（按 AGPL-3.0 使用）、VST3 SDK（GPL-3.0）、AudioUnitSDK（Apache-2.0）和
  pocketfft（BSD-3-Clause）合在一起，整体按 GPLv3 发布，其中 JUCE 的部分按 AGPLv3。
  许可全文在 LICENSES/ 里，第三方组件见 THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md。

CORRESPONDING SOURCE (GPLv3 section 6(d)) / 对应源码

  Miciri @VERSION@   https://github.com/synchain-oss/miciri
                     commit @COMMIT@
  JUCE @JUCE_VERSION@          https://github.com/juce-framework/JUCE
                     commit @JUCE_COMMIT@

  To rebuild: check out the two commits above, then
    cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DJUCE_PATH=<JUCE checkout> -DMICIRI_HOST_PROBE=OFF
    cmake --build build
  The bundles are then under build/src/plugin.
